load_dofs.out
Test of DoF transformation in loads
StaticStructural nsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3dBeam
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 8 nelem 0 ncrosssect 0 nmat 0 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 3

# load on set
node 1         coords 3 0. 0. 0. dofidmask 6 1 2 3 4 5 6
rigidarmnode 2 coords 3 1. 0. 0. master 1 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 1 dofType 3 2 2 2

# load on node
node 3         coords 3 0. 0. 0.0 dofidmask 6 1 2 3 4 5 6
rigidarmnode 4 coords 3 1. 0. 0. master 3 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 1 dofType 3 2 2 2 load 1 2

# load on set - scrambled nodes
node 5         coords 3 0. 0. 0. dofidmask 6 1 2 3 4 5 6
rigidarmnode 6 coords 3 1. 0. 0. master 5 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 1 dofType 3 2 2 2

# load on node - scrambled dofs
node 7         coords 3 0. 0. 0.0 dofidmask 6 1 2 3 4 5 6
rigidarmnode 8 coords 3 1. 0. 0. master 7 dofidmask 3 1 3 5 masterMask 3 1 1 1 dofType 3 2 2 2 load 1 3

BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 6 1 2 3 4 5 6 values 6 0. 0. 0. 0. 0. 0. set 1

NodalLoad         2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 3 5 Components 3 10. 0. 0. set 2
# scrambled dofs - test the dof transformation
NodalLoad         3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 5 3 1 Components 3 0. 0. 10. set 3

ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
Set 1 nodes 4 1 3 5 7
Set 2 nodes 1 2
Set 3 nodes 1 6

#
# exact solution
#
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-8
## check reactions 
#REACTION tStep 1 number 1 dof 1 value  -10.0e+00
#REACTION tStep 1 number 3 dof 1 value  -10.0e+00
#REACTION tStep 1 number 5 dof 1 value  -10.0e+00
#REACTION tStep 1 number 7 dof 1 value  -10.0e+00
#%END_CHECK%
